<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Galatia Mingei</para>
  <para style="toc1">GALATIA Mingei kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt1">GALATIA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mingei kôma Paul Lekhamuthuon</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">Thurchi sa hi a hong inzara, Jentailngei khomin an iem zoia. Khristien diktak ni rangin Judangei angin Moses Balam jôm ngêt anâng le nângloi minthâr anâng zoia. Paul han Judangei anga om anâng ti maka, Khrista iempungei ta ranga tho rang anâng chu taksôn chien hih ani tiin a tia. Ania, Galatia sûnga koiindangngei hih Asia ram chîn uola Rom sorkar huolsûnga inkhat ani. Paul minchuna doi rang anga “Pathien makunga thei inchang rang han Moses Balam jôm ngêt sa rang ani” ti mi senkhatin hih iemtharngei hih an bea, mi tamtak chu an lâka.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Galatimingei kôma Paul lekhamuthuon</char> Minchuna dikloi lei jûingei hin iemna dik an hong riet minthâr theina rangin hi lekha hih Paul'n a miziek ani. Tîrton dik ani tie a misîra, miriem inkhâm ni loiin Pathien ngêtin a koia, Jentail lâia sintho rang chong a misîr minthâra, Khrista iempungei om chang chu lungkhamnân an sip rang ani tie a misîr nôk.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmasana <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-10">1:1-10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Paul tîrton anina roi <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:21">1:11—2:21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pathien moroina thurchisa <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 3:1-4:31">3:1—4:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Khristien zalênna le sinpêl <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1—6:10</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Chongkhârna <char style="ior"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Paul, Miriem renga niloi, miriem jâra khom niloi, Jisua Khrista le thina renga kaithoipu Pathien jâra tîrton keima. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Male ko ompui sûngsuokngei nâmin Galatia taka om koiindangngei chibai nangni an muthuon;<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Pa Pathien le ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista renga moroina le inngêina nangni pêk rese.<verse eid="GAL 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Atûnlâi rammuol sietna renga Khrista'n mi kêlsuo theina rangin, ei Pathien le ei Pa lungdo jômin, ei nunsie sikin ama ânpêk zoi. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Pathien kôma inlalna tuonsôtin om rese, Amen.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Thurchisa adang ommak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Khrista moroina jâra nangni koipu hah irang mo inrangtaka nin mâka, Thurchisa dang nin ipom hih nangni ka kamâm.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Khrista moroina jâra; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngeia chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ama moroina sikin,</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Maha thurchisa adang viek ni uolma, mi senkhatngei hin nangni minjêlin Khrista thurchisa thûl an bôk kêng ani. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Nikhomsenla, keinin mo, invân renga vântîrton khomin mo thurchisa dang an misîr duoiin chu meidîla rang theiloiintumin om rese. <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Motona kin ti anghan kin ti nôk, nin pomsa thurchisa hah niloia thurchisa dang nin kôm juong misîr an omin chu, ama hah meidîla rang theiloiintumin om rese.<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Keiman atûn hin miriemngei pomna zong mo kini? Nitet mak! Keiman ka nuom chu Pathien pomna kêng! Miriem riming inthangna rang rok ka la nîn chu, Khrista tîrlâm ki ni loi rang ani.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inmo Paul tîrton a hongchang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Ma anghan, sûngsuokngei, thurchisa nangni ki ril hah miriem tienga chong ni mak iti nangni minriet rong. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Miriem kôm renga ka man ni maka, tute mi minchu khom ni mak. Mahah Jisua Khrista'n ko kôm lelea ânlâr ani.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Juda sakhuo balama kênpêk lâia ko om lam hah nin riet; Pathien Koiindangngei lungkhamna boiin dengminthei ngeia, theidôra minmang ngei rang bôkin ke lei oma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Sin 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 22:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Hanchu, ki richibulngei chong mâk chunga kênpêk uol ngâi sikin Juda balama ki sinthona han ki richingei lâia ka ruolngei tamtak chu ke khêl ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:3">Sin 22:3</ref></char></note><verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Hannirese, Pathien'n a moroinân ka nu vonsûnga ko omlâi renga mi thangsai, a sin tho rangin milei koi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15,16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Sin 9:3-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-10">22:6-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:13-18">26:13-18</ref></char></note> Male ama'n mi mindon ha, <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>Jentailngei lâia Thurchi Sa ki misîr theina ranga a Nâipasal ko kôma ânlâr han tute rekel loiin; <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Jerusalema ko motona tîrton lei changngei kôm khom se khâi loiin, Arab rama ke se kelena, masuole Damascus'a ko hongkîr nôka. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Hanchu, kum thum suole chu, Peter kôm roi ngei riet rangin Jerusalema kava sea, a kôma hapta nik ka va oma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:26-30">Sin 9:26-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Ania, Pumapa lâibungpa Jacob<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jacob telloi chu tute tîrton dangngei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">tute tîrton dang ngei; midang ku mu chu Jacob vai ani.</char></note> telloi chu tute tîrton dangngei mu mu-ung.<verse eid="GAL 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Nin kôma chong ki miziek hih adik ani. Milak tho mu-ung iti Pathien'n a riet.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Masuole han Syria le Cilicia ramhuol sûnga ke se zoi ani. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Ma zora han Judea rama Koiindangngeiin ke mêl la riet mak ngeia; <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>“Motona mi esêlpu le iemna ahong minboi phar rang bôk ngâipu han atûn hin chu taksônna chong kêng a misîr zoi” ti mi misîrna vai an riet. <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Ma anghan, keima sikin Pathien an minpâk zoi.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Paul le tîrton dangngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Hanchu, kum sômleiminli suole, Barnabas le Titus tuongin Jerusalema kin se nôka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:30">Sin 11:30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:2">15:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Pathien ânlâra mitîr sikin ke se ani. Koiindang ruoipungei leh atheiin kin chong khôma Jentailngei lâia thurchisa ki misîr ngâi hih an kôm ki rilminthâr pe ngeia; zora lei vunsaia ki sinthona mo, atûnlâia mo, mok sôl ki ni loina rangin. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Ania kên ruoipui Titus hih Greek mi aniatachu rangrâtin sertan min tho uol mak ngei. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Sûngsuok rothol, inrûka hong lûtngei vai han sertan tho ngêt rang an bôka; ma-ngei han suoka min minchang theina rangin Khrista Jisua zalêna ei nei hih enrichik ranga lût an ni. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Aniatachu, thurchisa chongtak hah ninta ranga aom bang theina rangin hapkhat khom an chong jôm makme.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Ania, ruoipu uola an ibe ngei hah i-anga mi khom nisenla, keima rangin chu ite dang uol mak, Pathien'n chu pêntienga ânlang a jêk ngâiloi sikin, mangei han sin tho rang tie athar ite mi ril thei uol makngei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Bal 10:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Manêkin Juda ngei lâia thurchisa misîrna sin Peter minkola aom anghan, keima Jentailngei lâia thurchisa misîrna sin keima minkolin ko om iti an riet. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Pathien'n, ranakin Peter Judangei tîrton a minchang anghan kei khom Jentailngei tîrton mi minchang. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Pathien'n hi sin ngêt hih mipêk ti hih ruoipungei, Jacob, Peter le John ngei khomin an rieta, Keima Jentailngei lâia se rangin le anni Judangei lâia se rangin keima le Barnabas inlopna kut changtieng min lei pêk zoi. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>An lâia inriengngei hah kin riettit rangin an nuoma, ma tak hah tho ranga ka lei ngâklal ngâi khom ani.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Antioch khuoa Paul'n Peter a ngo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Hanchu, Peter hah Antioch a hong lâihan dik mak ti inthâr takin ânlang sikin, loko ngei rietin mâi intongin ko ngoa. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Jentailngei lâia bu a nêk ngâia, ania Jacob kôm renga mi senkhat Jentail sermintan rang bôkngei hah a chia, an hong tung lechu a chia, a theiin a om zoi. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Juda dangngei khom Peter thâiindôp anghan an thâiândôp suo zoia; Barnabas tena an thâiindôpnân an tuong minmang sa zoi. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Ania, thurchisa chong takin lôn mak ti ki rieta an rênga makunga Peter kôma, “Nangma Juda mi ni nia, Judangei om anghan om loiin Jentailngei om anghin, irang mo Jentailngei hah Judangei anga min om ngêt rang no bôka? ki tipea.”<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Judangei le Jentailngei hah taksônna sika sanminring an ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Eini chu Juda mi rang piela suok ei nia, “Jentail mi nunsie ngei” an ti ngâi angin ni makme. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Aniatachu, Jisua Khrista taksônna sika vai, Balam jôm sika ni loiin, mîn Pathien makunga dik ei chang thei iti ei riet; Balamin a nângngei jôm sika ni loia Khrista iem sika Pathien makunga dik ei chang theina rangin keini ngêt khom Khrista han taksônna kin min ngam ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 143:2">Lap 143:2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 3:20">Rom 3:20</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 3:22">22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Khrista leh inzoma Pathien kôm dik chang rang ei bôk lâi hin Jentailngei anghan ei la nunsie bang inte, Khrista hih nunsie thona mi sanpu mo ai ni? nitet mak! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Balam keset sa hah ki minding nôkin chu balam sietpu ki ni iti ânthâr. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Pathien tienga ki ring theina rangin keichu Khrista leh khrosa jêmdel ki ni zoi, Balam a om sikin Balam tieng chu ki thi ani zoi. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Khrista kôm jêmdelin ko om zoia, aniatachu, ki ring ani, keima chu ni khâi mu unga, Khrista hah keima han a ring zoi ani. Atûna taksa taka ki ring hih, mi lungkhampu kei ranga ringna pêkpu, Pathien Nâipasal taksôna ring kini. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Pathien moroina hih heng mu-ung. Ania, Balam sikin Pathien kôm mîn dik an inchang theiin chu Khrista chu asenaboia thi nîng a tih!<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Balam nônchu taksônna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>O, Galatia rama mi mo ngei, tumo nangni dôi? Nin mitmu ngêta Jisua Khrista hah khrosa jêmdel ani tie ânthârtaka ânlang anga han. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Ma inkhat hih mi ril ta u; Balamin ai nâng ngei sintho sikin mo Pathien Ratha hah nin man, Thurchisa nin rangâia nin rieta nin iem sikin mo? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Inmo madôrpa nin moh theia, Pathien Ratha leh nin phut hah atûn nin theia rachamin min mong rang nin nuom mo ani? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Ma angdôra nin tuongna hah môk tutuong mo ani rang? nitet noni! <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Hanchu Pathien Ratha nangni a pêka, nin lâia sininkhêl ai tho hah Balamin anâng ngei nin sin sika mo, Thurchisa nin rieta nin iem sika mo? <verse eid="GAL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Abraham'n a leirietna hah mindon roh, Pathien lekhabu'n ai ti anghan Abraham'n Pathien a iema, ha a taksônna hah a diknân ipompe ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Aph 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 4:3">Rom 4:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:16">Rom 4:16</ref></char></note> Masikhan a taksôn mingei nâm chu Abraham richi diktak an ni, ti riet roi. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Aph 12:3</ref></char></note> Pathien lekhabu han aphuonga, Pathien'n an taksônna sikin Jentailngei dik a minchang rang ani. Hanchu Thurchi Sa han Abraham kôma, “Nangma renga hah miriem murdi satvur a tih,” tiin a lei ril suo zoi ani. <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Abraham'n Pathien a iema, satvura a om anghan, a iem ngei murdi chu satvurin an om.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 27:26">Bal 27:26</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Balam jôm vaia inngam ngei chu khomâksâmna nuoia an oma, Pathien lekhabu'n, “Balambua ânziek murdi jôm tit loi kai chu Pathien khomâksâmna nuoia an om ani,” ati. <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Masikin, balam jômin Pathien makunga tute dik intum mak ngei, ti hih ânthâr zoi; Pathien lekhabu'n, “taksôn sika Pathien makunga dik intum ngei vai ring an tih,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pathien makunga dik intum ngei vai ring an tih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">taksôn sika Pathien makunga dik intum ngei vai ring an tih.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:4">Heb 2:4</ref></char></note> ati sikin. <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Och 18:5</ref></char></note> Aniatachu, Balam leh taksônna chu ân manna om maka, manêkin, “Tukhomin Balamin ai ti murdi <char style="it">thopu</char> chu ring an tih,” ati ani.<verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 21:23">Bal 21:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Aniatachu, Khrista hah ei ruthûla khomâksâm lei nîn, balam khomâksâm renga mi khôk zoi ani; Pathien lekhabu'n, “Tukhom thinga makhâi chu Pathien khomâksâm chang ani” ati. <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Khrista'n ma-ngei murdi a tuongna chu Abraham chunga Pathien satvurna hah Khrista Jisua jâra Jentailngei chunga a hong om theina rang le taksônna sika Ratha inkhâm hah ei chang theina ranga ani.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balam le chongkhâm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Ka malngei, nîngtina nin riet ngâi neinun enminkhinân ka mang rang ani hi; mi inikin an chonginkhâma inruol senla ngei, pominruolna chong nei senla ngei; ha an chong hah tutên set thei noni ngei, bôk khom bôk thei noni ngei. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Atûn Pathien chonginkhâm ngei hah Abraham le a richisuonpârngei kôma a pêka, Pathien lekhabu'n mi tamtak chungroi a misîr loi anghan “Richisuonpârngei,” ti maka, mi inkhat vai rilna anghan “Jâisuon” ai ti ani, ama hah Khrista ani. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:40">Jôk 12:40</ref></char></note> Imo ki tina tak chu, chonginkhâm Pathien'n Abraham kôma, a lei phun mindetsa hah, kum razaminli kum sômthum suoleh balam hong oma han Pathien chonginkhâm hah mangmunboi achang loina rangin thonpai uol mak. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:14">Rom 4:14</ref></char></note> Asikchu Pathien neinunpêk hah Balama ânngam rang anînchu, chonginkhâm sika ni khâi nonih; aniatachu, Pathien'n chonginkhâm sika kêng, Abraham kôm neinunpêk ai pêk. <verse eid="GAL 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Ma anghan ni senla, balam hi itho sika mo pêk ai ni? Pathien'n chonginkhâm a pêkna Abraham jâisuon hah a hong om mâka minchâina ânlang theina rangin Balam hah ipêk ani. Ma Balam hah vântîrtonngei leh palâi imanga a mingei kôm juong mintung ani. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Aniatachu chonginkhâm a pêk lâihan palâi nâng loiin mi inkhat vai ân chela; male Pathien chu inkhat ani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">male Pathien chu inkhat ani; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nônchu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">male athenin asina.</char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Balamin ai khîn ngei hah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Ma anghan nisenla, Pathien chonginkhâm hih balam hin ânkal mo? Inkal mak! Miriemngei'n ring theina rang balam an lei man nisenla chu, mitinin ha balam hah jômin Pathien kôm dik inchangin an om rang ani zoi. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Ania, Pathien lekhabua han, rammuol pumpui hih nunsie nuoia a om a ti; masikin Jisua Khrista taksônna sika manboipêk inkhâm hah a iem ngei kôm han pêk ani.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Ania, Taksônna ahong om mân, taksônna ajuong inlâr mâka han chu, ha balam han mi intâng ina om anghan mi khitphier ani. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Maleh taksônna sika Pathien kôma dik ei chang theina rangin balam hah Khrista juong mâka han chu eini ni lei enkolpu ani. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Atûn chu taksônna a om zoi sikin balamin ni kairuoi khâi mak.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Taksônna sikin kêng nin rêngin Khrista Jisua leh inzomin Pathien nâingei nin ni. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Khrista leh inzomin baptis nin chang zoia, atûnchu Khrista ringnân nin invoa, ama leh nin chonga, Khrista ringna han inzomkhôm nin ni zoi. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Masikin Juda le jentail khom tei uolna reng ommak, suok le suok niloi khom pasal le nupang khom, Khrista Jisua leh inzomin nin rêngin inkhat nin ni. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 4:13">Rom 4:13</ref></char></note> Hanchu, Khrista mi nin nînchu Abraham richi ngei nin ni zoi; Pathien'n ânkhâmna hah nin man rang ani.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Nikhomsenla, keiman ki ti nuom chu, nâi, a pa rochon murdi luo rangpu hah nâipang a lani kâr chu suok leh ite tei uol mak, neinun murdi a ta ni let khom rese. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Nâipang a lani sûng kâr chu, a pa zora khâm atung mâka chu a donsûipu le a rochon jêkpepu a om ngâi ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Ma anghan eini khom ratha tieng ulien eini mân chu, rammuol ratha saloi ruoina nuoia suok ei chang ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Aniatachu, zora khâm a hong tung tik han, Pathien'n a nâipasal a juongtîr ani. Mahan nupang sûnga inzirin, Juda balam nuoia a lênga; <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 8:15-17">Rom 8:15-17</ref></char></note> Pathien nâingei ni theina ranga Balam nuoia om ngei murdi mirtan rangin.<verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Hanchu, a nâingei nin ni ti rietnân, Pathien'n a Nâipasal Ratha hah ei mulungrîla a juongtîra, Ratha han, “Abba” O Pa tiin ei iniek ngâi ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Masika han, suok ni khâi mak cheia, nâi nin ni zoi. Hanchu, nâi nin nina sikin Pathien'n a nâingei ranga ânkhâm murdi hah nangni pêk a tih.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Paul'n Galatia mingei a mindon tie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Tienlâi hanchu Pathien la riet mak cheia, masikin pathien ni ngâiloi ngei suoka nin om ngâi. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Ania atûn chu Pathien nin hong riet zoia, nônchu Pathien'n nangni riet suonûkin, inmo adok le inrieng om ratha ngei ruoina dikloi tieng inhei nôk rang nin nuoma? Inmo an suok chang nôkrêk rangin nin nuoma? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Nangnin nikhuongei, thâ ngei, kumtentana ngei, kumngei, nin ser ngâia. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Nin chungroi nangni ka kamâm sabak ani! Ninta ranga ki sin murdi mangmunboi achang rang mini?<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Ka malngei, nangni anga ko om anghin nangni khom keima anghin om roi, tiin nangni ke ngên. Nangnin adikloiin ite mi lo mak chei. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Ka damloina sikin motontaka thurchisa nangni ki ril hah nangnîn nin rieta. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Ka taksa dingmun hah nangni ranga minsinna lientak khom nisenla, mi mumâkin ni hengpai mak chei. Ma-ang nêkhan invâna vântîrton anghan le Khrista Jisua anghan mi nin modôm ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Nin râiasân bâka! itho mo? thei nisenla chu nin mitngei khom kêlpai nin ta mipêk nin tih ki ti thei. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Chongdik hah nangni ki ril sikin nin râl ka chang zoi mo?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Midangngei han lunghâng nangni an tho sabak, ania an mindona sa mak. An nuom tak chu keima leh nangni minsen rang, hanke lunghâng nangni an tho anghan, nangni khomin lunghâng nin tho ngei rang hah ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Mindonna asa anîn chu ma anga lunghângna hi khotik khom asa ani, nin kôma ko om lâi vai niloiin. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Ka nâi moroingei! avêllin voikhat, Khrista nina hah nin kôm sin mindetin a om mâka chu nupang nâiha phut anape ngâi anga na han nin rang sikin ku tuong ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Male atûn hin nin kôm honga chong rôlûm dangin thurchi misîr ku nuoma; ithomo ei tiin chu nin chungroi ka kângdoi sabak ani.<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hagar le Sarah minenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Balam nuoia om nuomngei hah, nangni rekel rong; Balamin ai ti hah nin rietloi mo? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:15">Aph 16:15</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:2">Aph 21:2</ref></char></note> Ma anghin a ti, Abraham'n nâipasal inik a dôna inkhat chu a suoknu nâi ania, inkhat chu suok niloinu nâi ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Suoknu leh an nâi hah chu taksa balam anghan ânzira, suok niloinu leh an nâi ha chu Pathien chongkhâm sikin ânzir iti hih. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Ma chong hah chongmintêka riet thei ani; ma nupang inik ngei hah chonginkhit inik an ni. A nâingei suoknu renga ânzir a nu hah Hagar ania, Sinai tânga chonginkhit hah ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Male Hagar hah Arabia rama Sinai tâng hah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hagar … tâng hah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iti hih miziek senkhatngei chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sinai hih Arabia rama muol inkhat, le mahi, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn.</char></note> ania, atûnlâia Jerusalem khuopuiliena mi murdi ngei le suoka omngei leh hin munkhat an ni. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Hannirese, suok niloinu hah chu chung tieng Jerusalem ania, suok nimaka, hanu hah ei nû ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Isa 54:1</ref></char></note> Pathien lekhabu'n;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Nangma aching nâi nei ngâi loi, Na râiminsân roh!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Nangma nâiha la doi tet ngâiloi, Râisânin tânghâi roh!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Nupang a pasalin ai mathân tet ngâiloi nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">Nêkin nupang mi imâknu han nâi nei mintam uol a tih,” tiin ânziek sikin.<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Atûn nangni ka malngei, eini khom Isaac anghan Pathien chongkhâm nâingei eini. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:9">Aph 21:9</ref> </char></note> Ma zora lâihan, taksa balama suokpu han Pathien Ratha lama suokpu hah deng-amintheia, atûn hin khom ma anghan ani. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Aph 21:10</ref></char></note> Aniatachu Pathien lekhabu'n imo ai ti hah? “Suoknu le a nâipasal chu rujûlpai roh; suoknu nâipasal han suok niloinu nâipasal leh a pa rochon luopui thei no nih. <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Masikin, ka malngei, suoknu nâingei ni mak mea, suok niloinu nâingei kêng eini.”<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s">Nin zalênna hôi roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Zalênna ei nei chu, Khrista han mi mojôk zoi! Hanchu zalên mingei ang takin inding det ungla nin theiin suok achang nôk rangin inphal khâi no roi.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Rangâi roi! keima Paul'n nin kôm ki ti ani, sertan rangin nin inphalin chu Khrista hah ninta rangin ite asena om tet loi nîng a tih. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Sertan ngei ngân chu balam chong murdi jôm ranga nuom an ni iti ki min riet nôk. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Balam jôm sika Pathien kôma adik inchang abôk ngei, Khrista leh nin insen zoia, Pathien moroina pêntieng han nin om ani. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Keini rangin chu, kin taksônnân Pathien Ratha sinthotheina jârin Pathien kôm adik inchang kin tih iti kin sabei ani. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Khrista Jisua leh inzomna han chu sertan khom, sertanloi khom ite ateina ommak, lungkhamna sika taksôna sin vai asêna aom ani.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Nin tho minsa sabak! chongdik hah nin jôm loina rangin tumo nangni akhap? Inmo nangni a methêm. <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Mahi chu nangni koipu Pathien renga chu nitet mak. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:6">1 Kor 5:6</ref></char></note>An ti anghan, “Chol hâr chînte hin vâipôl pumpui athoi zit ngâi.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Aniatachu, nangni ka la taksôn tit Pumapa ei ringna ân zomna sikin mindonna dang uol nei no tunui ti ka sabei; hanchu, nangni minjêlpu ha chu i-anga mi nikhomsenla, Pathien'n dûkmintong a tih.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Ka malngei keiman sertan anâng tiin lei misîr ngâi inlang, ithomo dûk ko tong ranga? Ma anghan nisenla, khros chong ki misîr hin intakna suok no nih. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Nangni minjêl kai chu sertan vai ni loiin, ma anghan tho lilia rese ngei anthenin tanpit rese ngei ku nuom ani.<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Ka malngei, nangni chu zalên ranga koi nin ni. Aniatachu nin zalênna hah nin taksa mulungbôkngei rangin zoranchumin mang no roi. Manêkin, in lungkham inlômin sintho insan inlôm roi. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Och 19:18</ref></char></note>“Nangma nên lungkham anghan nu bungmingei lungkham roh” iti chong hin Balam pumpui chongpêk inkhatin a kaikhôm let ani. <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Aniatachu, ramsa anghan nin inpetta, nin insâk inlôm duoiin chu, nin inmang let loina rangin indîn roi.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ratha le munisi nina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Ki ti chu mahih ani; ratha'n nin ringnun ruoi rese, hanchu, miriem nina mulungbôkngei hah nin jôm loi rang ani. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 7:15-23">Rom 7:15-23</ref></char></note>Ei miriem nina mulungbôk hah ratha mulungbôkin a doi ngâia, ratha mulungbôk khom miriem nina mulungbôkin adoi ngâi. Ma ngei inik hah râl an ni. Masikin nin sin tho nuomngei hah nin tho theiloina ani. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Ratha'n nangni a ruoia anin chu Balam nuoia ommak chei.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Miriem nina sintho ngei chu ânlang-iem. Mangei hah inditnasaloingei, inthiengloina ngei, hurna ngei, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>mirimil biekna ngei, dôi theina ngei. Mingei râl inchangin an indoia, an innarsaa, an ningathika an inmumâka. Pâl dang le lôm dangin an inkêm ngâi. <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>narsana ngei, ju inrûina ngei, hurinliekna ngei le ma anga adang dang an tho ngâi. Motona nangni ke lei ril sai anghan atûn khom nangni ki ril nôk, ma anga sin tho ngei hah chu Pathien Rêngram luo tet noni ngei.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Aniatachu Ratha mara chu; lungkhamna ngei, râisâna ngei, inngêina ngei, tuongtheina ngei moroina ngei, satna ngei, taksôn omna ngei, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>rangâiinchîna ngei le indîntheina ngei hih ani. Ma ngei akal rangin balam reng ommak. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Khrista Jisua mingei chu an miriem nina hah an mindonna le an mulungbôkngei murdi leh an that suozoi. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Ratha'n ringna thar mi pêk zoia; ama'n ei ringnun khom a jêk ngêt rang ani. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Inpâka, insuol inkhalin le inkhat le inkhat innarsân ei om tet rang nimak.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">Puokpêl insan inlôm roi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Ka malngei, mi tumakhatin nunsie sinin in ôk senla, nangni ratha mingeiin nin mindik rang ani; hannirese, mulung innêm takin nin tho rang ani. Nangni khom huongna han nin lût sa loina rangin in enchak roi. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Nin puokpêl insan inlôm roi; hanchu Khrista balam nin jôm nîng atih.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nin jôm nîng atih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhata chu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jôm ani.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Nangman ite ni tetloia milien takin nênbên chu nethena ânhuong ni ni. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Nin sin tho chit injêk bak ungla. Asa anin chu, mi sintho leh mintêk loiin, maleh nin sin thoa han insong thei nin tih. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Nin rêngin nin puok chit nin pêl rang sikin.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Nangma hah Khristien chong minchuna changpu ninia anînchu neinun sa no dôn murdi nang a minchupu kôma han ne sem sa rang ani.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>Nin theiin inhuong no roi; tutên Pathien a môh mintum no roi. Nu tu tak hah na ât rang ani. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Na taksa ngâituina tienga nerthên chu thina hah ât na ta, Ratha tienga nu tua anînchu na ratha han kumtuong ringna hah ât atih. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Masikin sin sa sin sôl no ih, ei mâk nônchu a ât zora la hong tung ngêt a tih. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Ma anghan zora sa ei man dôr han mitin chunga sin sa sin ei ti u, aliekin taksônna han ei inmi ngei chunga sin uol ei ti u.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rilna nûktak le chibaimûkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Keima kut ngêta nin kôma inrolbura ki miziek hih en ta u! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Sertan ranga nangni pût ngâingei hah apêntieng korong minlanga, ânpâk nuomngei hah an ni. An tho ngâi nikhomrese, Khrista khros sika nuomlona an jôkna rang papaia an itho ngâi ani. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Sertan ngei luo khomin Balam hah jôm ngâi makngei; taksa balama nin inpêk tia an insong theina rang ser nangni mintan nuom kêng an ni. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Nikhomresea, keiman rang chu, ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista khros vai song ki tih, ha a khros jâra han rammuol hih ka rangin jêmdelin a om zoia, kei khom rammuol rangin jêmdelin ko om zoi. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Miriem insintharna tiloi chu sertan le tanloi ite nimak. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Male an ringnuna ma balam a jûi ngei chunga le Pathien mingei chunga inngêina le moroina om rese!<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Amongna rangin: atûn pêna chu tutên mimintak khâi no rese; isikamo ei tiin chu ka takchunga sabe hin Jisua suok kini hih a minlang ani.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Ka malngei ei Pumapa Jisua Khrista moroina hah nin rênga kôma han om rese. Amen.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
